% the_burn - get them onto the oil, someone lights it
%
% Needs a region whose feature fire blasts lethally, an enemy that can be
% brought there, and a companion holding a fire skill. Everyone else who can
% be brought in and exposed goes up in the same blast: one match, one fire.
% The reaction consumes the feature - after the burn there is nothing left
% to freeze or to burn again. The oil is the level's own primer, so the burn
% has one role, pay-off, and anyone with fire may take it; who brings the
% enemies in is decided by who holds a pull, a push or a dash.

theBurn(?e) :-
    if(role(?e, enemy), not(status(?e, dead)), not(immune(?e, fire)),
       regionHas(?r, ?feat), reacts(fire, ?feat, ?new), blast(fire, ?feat, dead)),
    do(bringTo(?e, ?r), expose(?e), try(gatherOthers(?e, ?r)), detonate(fire, ?r)).

% Every other living enemy that can be brought in and exposed, is.
gatherOthers(?e, ?r) :-
    allOf, if(role(?o, enemy), \==(?o, ?e), not(status(?o, dead)), not(at(?o, ?r))),
    do(bringTo(?o, ?r), expose(?o)).
